    "text": "Published. Three corrections in three days. The fourth is yours to send.",
    "emotion": "warm",
    "bucket": "quest",
    "file": "shared/apprenticeVoiceLines.ts"
  },
  {
    "id": "scholar_male_quest_resolution_break",
    "character": "apprentice_scholar_male",
    "text": "Retracted. The disciplines clapped. I'm still reading what I wrote.",
    "emotion": "raw",
    "bucket": "quest",
    "file": "shared/apprenticeVoiceLines.ts"
  },
  {
    "id": "scholar_male_romance_marginalia",
    "character": "apprentice_scholar_male",
    "text": "I write to you in marginalia. Don't read it in order.",
    "emotion": "soft",
    "bucket": "romance",
    "file": "shared/apprenticeVoiceLines.ts"
  },
  {
    "id": "scholar_male_romance_library",
    "character": "apprentice_scholar_male",
    "text": "Meet me in the library at the third turn. Bring nothing.",
    "emotion": "tender",
    "bucket": "romance",
    "file": "shared/apprenticeVoiceLines.ts"
  },
  {
    "id": "scholar_male_dlg_past_opener_0",
    "character": "apprentice_scholar_male",
    "text": "I found a footnote in my grandfather's copy of the Founders' Chronicle that he had written in the margin in a hand that was not his.",
    "emotion": "dialogue",
    "bucket": "dialogue",
    "file": "shared/apprenticeDialogues.ts",
    "dialogueTopic": "past"
  },
  {
    "id": "scholar_male_dlg_past_opener_1",
    "character": "apprentice_scholar_male",
    "text": "I have spent eleven cycles trying to figure out whose hand it was.",
    "emotion": "dialogue",
    "bucket": "dialogue",
    "file": "shared/apprenticeDialogues.ts",
    "dialogueTopic": "past"
  },
  {
    "id": "scholar_male_dlg_past_s_past_warm_reply_0",
    "character": "apprentice_scholar_male",
    "text": "I narrowed it to four people. Two of them died before he was born. That makes for an excellent paper and an unsolvable problem. I am, mostly, reconciled.",
    "emotion": "dialogue",
    "bucket": "dialogue",
    "file": "shared/apprenticeDialogues.ts",
    "dialogueTopic": "past"
  },
  {
    "id": "scholar_male_dlg_past_s_past_probe_reply_0",
    "character": "apprentice_scholar_male",
    "text": "Because the footnote contradicts the body of the text. Whoever wrote it knew something the canon didn't. If I find them, I find a hidden voice. The canon shifts.",
    "emotion": "dialogue",
    "bucket": "dialogue",
    "file": "shared/apprenticeDialogues.ts",
    "dialogueTopic": "past"
  },
  {
    "id": "scholar_male_dlg_past_s_past_probe_s_past_probe_deep_reply_0",
    "character": "apprentice_scholar_male",
    "text": "'The Founders did not arrive in twelve. They arrived in thirteen. The thirteenth was eaten by procedure.'",
    "emotion": "dialogue",
    "bucket": "dialogue",
    "file": "shared/apprenticeDialogues.ts",
    "dialogueTopic": "past"
  },
  {
    "id": "scholar_male_dlg_past_s_past_probe_s_past_probe_deep_reply_1",
    "character": "apprentice_scholar_male",
    "text": "I have not been able to publish it. The disciplines are not ready. I'm telling you because you read me twice before you replied. That is the proper review pace.",
    "emotion": "dialogue",
    "bucket": "dialogue",
    "file": "shared/apprenticeDialogues.ts",
    "dialogueTopic": "past"
  },
  {
    "id": "scholar_male_dlg_past_s_past_probe_s_past_probe_back_reply_0",
    "character": "apprentice_scholar_male",
    "text": "Sometimes. I have considered the possibility. I have not yet decided to believe it.",
    "emotion": "dialogue",
    "bucket": "dialogue",
    "file": "shared/apprenticeDialogues.ts",
    "dialogueTopic": "past"
  },
  {
    "id": "scholar_male_dlg_past_s_past_cold_reply_0",
    "character": "apprentice_scholar_male",
    "text": "I prefer to call it a research arc. The decade was well spent. The hobby insults itself.",
    "emotion": "dialogue",
    "bucket": "dialogue",
    "file": "shared/apprenticeDialogues.ts",
    "dialogueTopic": "past"
  },
  {
    "id": "scholar_male_dlg_calling_opener_0",
    "character": "apprentice_scholar_male",
    "text": "Every page is a conversation between the people who wrote it and the people who read it. The footnotes are the only place the readers get to talk back.",
    "emotion": "dialogue",
    "bucket": "dialogue",
    "file": "shared/apprenticeDialogues.ts",
    "dialogueTopic": "calling"
  },
  {
    "id": "scholar_male_dlg_calling_opener_1",
    "character": "apprentice_scholar_male",
    "text": "I am, mostly, the back-talker.",
    "emotion": "dialogue",
    "bucket": "dialogue",
    "file": "shared/apprenticeDialogues.ts",
    "dialogueTopic": "calling"
  },
  {
    "id": "scholar_male_dlg_calling_s_call_warm_reply_0",
    "character": "apprentice_scholar_male",
    "text": "So the next reader hears more than one voice. Most canon was written by people who thought they were finishing something. They weren't. I keep the conversation open.",
    "emotion": "dialogue",
    "bucket": "dialogue",
    "file": "shared/apprenticeDialogues.ts",
    "dialogueTopic": "calling"
  },
  {
    "id": "scholar_male_dlg_calling_s_call_probe_reply_0",
    "character": "apprentice_scholar_male",
    "text": "Once. I corrected my own correction of someone's correction. It took the disciplines two cycles to find the path back. I learned the lesson — citations have a half-life.",
    "emotion": "dialogue",
    "bucket": "dialogue",
    "file": "shared/apprenticeDialogues.ts",
    "dialogueTopic": "calling"
  },
  {
    "id": "scholar_male_dlg_calling_s_call_probe_s_call_probe_deep_reply_0",
    "character": "apprentice_scholar_male",
    "text": "About six cycles. After that the marginalia outweighs the original. I add a closing note. I publish the whole. The next scholar starts again from clean text. That is the cycle.",
    "emotion": "dialogue",
    "bucket": "dialogue",
    "file": "shared/apprenticeDialogues.ts",
    "dialogueTopic": "calling"
  },
  {
    "id": "scholar_male_dlg_calling_s_call_probe_s_call_probe_back_reply_0",
    "character": "apprentice_scholar_male",
    "text": "I write the closing note before I think I need it. I publish a cycle early, not late. Most of the corners I've seen come from waiting.",
    "emotion": "dialogue",
    "bucket": "dialogue",
    "file": "shared/apprenticeDialogues.ts",
    "dialogueTopic": "calling"
  },
  {
    "id": "scholar_male_dlg_calling_s_call_cold_reply_0",
    "character": "apprentice_scholar_male",
    "text": "Then the conversation closes. The page becomes a tomb. I'd rather have the noise.",
    "emotion": "dialogue",
    "bucket": "dialogue",
    "file": "shared/apprenticeDialogues.ts",
    "dialogueTopic": "calling"
  },
  {
    "id": "scholar_male_dlg_mortality_opener_0",
    "character": "apprentice_scholar_male",
    "text": "If I die, cite me Vancouver style. Year. Title in italics. Page numbers exact. Don't paraphrase.",
    "emotion": "dialogue",
    "bucket": "dialogue",
    "file": "shared/apprenticeDialogues.ts",
    "dialogueTopic": "mortality"
  },
  {
    "id": "scholar_male_dlg_mortality_opener_1",
    "character": "apprentice_scholar_male",
    "text": "Above all, do not cite me with the wrong middle initial. The disciplines will know you didn't read me.",
    "emotion": "dialogue",
    "bucket": "dialogue",
    "file": "shared/apprenticeDialogues.ts",
    "dialogueTopic": "mortality"
  },
  {
    "id": "scholar_male_dlg_mortality_s_mort_warm_reply_0",
    "character": "apprentice_scholar_male",
    "text": "Then you'll see the corrections I've already made. The third draft is the one to keep. The first two are footnotes to themselves.",
    "emotion": "dialogue",
    "bucket": "dialogue",
    "file": "shared/apprenticeDialogues.ts",
    "dialogueTopic": "mortality"
  },
  {
    "id": "scholar_male_dlg_mortality_s_mort_probe_reply_0",
    "character": "apprentice_scholar_male",
    "text": "Yes. Worse than dying. My grandfather's footnote may be misread for centuries. I refuse to be the next misread footnote.",
    "emotion": "dialogue",
    "bucket": "dialogue",
    "file": "shared/apprenticeDialogues.ts",
    "dialogueTopic": "mortality"
  },
  {
    "id": "scholar_male_dlg_mortality_s_mort_probe_s_mort_probe_deep_reply_0",
    "character": "apprentice_scholar_male",
